<title>JAPAN: Honda Motor shares hit new record high.</title>
<headline>Honda Motor shares hit new record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd shares hit a new record high in early morning trade on Thursday as investors eagerly snapped up the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0040 GMT, the share was up 70 yen at 3,060 yen, in turnover of 3.352 million shares, making it the second most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo stock exchange.</p>
<p>The previous high of 3,010 yen was set on June 25, 1996.</p>
